    "the August lineage is MEASURED byte for byte from the J2, J8, J18 and J19A receipts and the transplant report, not asserted as a constant.",
    "July semantics refined: no July checkpoint, actor weights, dataset, trace or labels as an operational parent or training input; July-derived constants, scaling code and the 25 mm diagnostic band allowed as disclosed informational sources; the JULY_FAITHFUL label no longer causes a false failure.",
    "the exact J19C values replace the rounded approximations.",
    "leaf file sets and committed maps are checked for exact size and for the absence of extras.",
    "training iteration counts are numeric zero, never boolean false."
  ],
